                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Rewrite Script Options Drawer (Hidden by default) -->
                <div id="rewriteOptionsDrawer" class="hidden bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-bold text-purple-900">
                        <span>✨ สั่ง Gemini ปรับแต่งสคริปต์สไตล์ต่างๆ:</span>
                        <button onclick="toggleRewriteOptions()" class="text-purple-500 hover:text-purple-700">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
